The '''Frozen Dimension''' is a [[Sea Events|sea event]]. 

==Spawning==
The Frozen Dimension exclusively spawns in [[Sea Danger Level|Sea Danger Level 6 '''<font color="8c00ff">(????)</font>''']].
* Bribing the [[Spy]] will significantly increase the chance of Frozen Dimension to spawn.
* The Frozen Dimension’s spawn chance is influenced by a pity system. The longer a player spends searching for it, the higher the likelihood it will spawn. However, the exact mechanics and values of this pity system are currently unknown.

;Notes
* The Frozen Dimension's spawning can be triggered by any number of players, although the [[Frozen Watcher]] will not spawn the [[Leviathan]] unless the [[Sea Exploration Group]] has five or more players.
* The Frozen Dimension can spawn regardless of whether the [[Spy]] is bribed, although the spawn chance is different.
* Players being on cooldown to bribe the [[Spy]] has no effect on the Frozen Dimension's spawn chance.

==Usage==
The Frozen Dimension is where the [[Frozen Watcher]] is located.

==Tips and Tricks==
* Players are recommended to [[Allying|ally]] each other as they might kill one another if they are in the [[Pirate]] team, or the players can also join the [[Marines]] for them to automatically ally with one another.
* Players should check if they still have enough people before entering [[Sea Danger Level|Sea Danger Level 6]] '''<font color="8c00ff">(????)</font>''', in order to prevent accidentally spawning Frozen Dimension when their [[Sea Exploration Group]] has less than 5 players, resulting in the waste of an opportunity to fight the [[Leviathan]]. But you still can spawn leviathan if you bring 5 or more players to the gate if you spawned it with less then 5 players on your group.
* It is recommended to have as many people as possible, as it reduces the chances of a fatal run. (The boat sinking or everyone dying)
* [[Portal]] users are able to despawn any skippable Sea Events such as [[Terrorshark]] using [[Portal]] {{Ability|Portal|V}}.

==Notes==
* Once Frozen Dimension appears, the entire [[Sea Danger Level#Level 6/????|Sea Danger Level]] 6 '''<font color="8c00ff">(????)</font>''' will be set at normal brightness.
* Spawning the Frozen Dimension causes every player in the same [[Sea Exploration Group]] who spawned the [[Leviathan]] to be placed on a "cooldown", making them unable to bribe the Spy. This means that the player must clear at least 20 [[Sea Events|sea events]] before being able to bribe the [[Spy]] again.
* If any player in a [[Sea Exploration Group]] has bribed the [[Spy]], the chances to spawn a Frozen Dimension will be increased for everyone in the Sea Exploration Group. Different players of the same group are able to bribe the [[Spy]], since the chances are stackable.
* The Frozen Dimension does not have a despawn time. However, it will despawn if there are no players nearby, which includes using Portal's {{Ability|Portal|V}}.

