==Trivia==
* The ice at the Frozen Dimension is slippery, which is especially noticeable when dashing.
* Frozen Dimension is one of the rarest and most difficult [[Sea Events|sea events]] to find, due to the [[Sea Danger Level]] requirement and other sea events likely being encountered along the way.
* The Frozen Dimension can spawn alongside other sea events (e.g. [[Mirage Island]]); there is a chance the [[Frozen Watcher]] may be blocked and therefore unusable.

